<div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4" data-controller="copy"><h1 class="page-title">Referral link / offer copy</h1><p>Checked when this page opened. Use the current offer terms and expiry when sharing. These links identify the campaign; they do not measure clicks or calculate commissions.</p><label for="influencer-copy" class="block">Copy text</label><textarea id="influencer-copy" readonly rows="8" class="input w-full" data-copy-target="source"><%= @copy %></textarea><button type="button" class="btn-primary" data-action="copy#copy">Copy to clipboard</button><span hidden data-copy-target="status" aria-live="polite">Copied</span><%= link_to 'Back', @back_url, class: 'btn-ghost' %></div>
